25402,"Check your account. Fraud Alert.
Good day! We have received a request from your account for a subscription quot;Skype unlimited {Earth|world|full planet|planet calls plan&quot; at App Store on a PC or another device that has not previously been connected with this account. This purchase was identified by our new automatic security service as a risky. In this respect, we have set hold for 5 days for the activation request of the purchasing. After this period, the required amount sum will be taken from your default payment option and the atonement will be brought into action. If you have bought this signup, please accept our apologies for this inconvenience and just ignore this letter. If this sign up was made by the mistake, and you want to unsubscribe, click the link under the sign-up options in this email, and then change the password on your Apple account, supposedly it was stolen. Subscription specifications: Sign up name: Skype unlimited Earth phone plan App name: Skype Developer: Skype inc. The time of sign up: 5 days Price for the period: 23.92 EUR Subscriber's IP address: 176.212.68.179 (Tolyatti, Russia) Unsubscribe and Manage Sign up We remind that your financial data is stored in security on our servers and nobody can reach it. We will never ask you to send us your account details, financial data and other private data by email or telephone. Thank you for using our service. Yours faithfully, The Apple team. Apple Inc. The terms of buying sign up you can find at the following link: Terms and Conditions Answers to frequently asked questions can be found at the following link: FAQ We respect your private life, the information of your data usage can be found here: Privacy Policy Copyright 2014 Apple Inc. Please do not reply to this email because we are not monitoring this inbox. To get in touch with us, log in to your account and click quot;Contact Squat; at the bottom of any page. Copyright 2015 Apple Inc. All rights reserved. Email ID eafdeeae035823beacdc.",i05,Account and Access Management