New Page Security Alert As part of our security measures, we regularly screen activity in the Lloyds TSB system. We recently contacted you after noticing an issue on your account. We requested information from you for the following reason: We have reason to believe that your account was accessed by a third party. Because protecting the security of your account is our primary concern, we have limited access to sensitive Lloyds TSB account features. We understand that this may be an inconvenience, but please understand that this temporary limitation is for your protection. In accordance with Lloyds TSB's User Agreement, your account access will remain limited until the issue has been resolved. Unfortunately, if access to your account remains limited for an extended period of time, it may result in further limitations or eventual account closure. We encourage you to log in to your Lloyds TSB account as soon as possible to help avoid this. Please follow the link below and fill in the necessary requirements to ensure account safety. https://online.lloydstsb.co.uk/customer.ibc?WT.svl=ibcplogon Yours Sincerely Anita Skinhead Of Online Services",i05,Account and Access Management,"GENERAL SETTINGS
