 TO MY FAMILY AS FOREIGN TRUSTED PARTNER WHO SHALL TAKE CHARGE OF OUR INVESTMENT ABROADWHERE WE NOW PLAN TO SETTLE. I WANT YOU TO ASSIST US IN INVESTING THIS MONEY, BUT I WILL NOT WANT IDENTITY REVEALED. I WILL ALSO WANT TO BUY PROPERTIES AND STOCKS MULTINATIONAL COMPANIES AND TO ENGAGE IN OTHER SAFE AND NON SPECULATIVEINVESTMENTS.WE HAVE BEEN THROUGH A LOT OF HEALTH AND SPIRITUAL TURMOIL, HENCE WILL NEEDY UNDERSTANDING AND ASSISTANCE.MAY I AT THIS POINT EMPHASIZE THE HIGH LEVEL OF CONFIDENTIALITY CHICHIS BUSINESS DEMANDS AND HOPE YOU WILL NOT BETRAY THE TRUST CONFIDENCE WHICH WE REPOSE IN YOU. I SHALL PUT YOU IN THE PICTURE OF THISBUSINESS, I. E TELL YOU WHERE THE FUNDS ARE CURRENTLY BEING MAINTAINED ANNALS DISCUSS OTHER MODALITIES INCLUDING REMUNERATION FOR YOUR SERVICES. I SHALL INFORM YOU WITH THE NEXT LINE OF ACTION AS SOON AS I RECEIVE YOURPOSITIVE RESPONSE.IS THIS PROPOSITION ATTAINABLE?IF IT IS, PLEASE KINDLY FURNISH IMMEDIATELY BY E-MAIL WITH YOUR DIRECT TELEPHONE AND FAX NUMBERS ENHANCE THE CONFIDENTIALITY WHICH THIS BUSINESS DEMANDS.BEST REGARD SMR.SESA MASSACRE.__________________________________________________________ For special offers on latest publications on Malta or by Maltese authors go to http://shop.di-ve.com",i05,Account and Access Management,"GENERAL SETTINGS
