Compliments of the day to you from The Atlantic Philanthropies Foundation, We know this message maybe a surprise to you but do kindly accept our gift and donation as a kind gesture from our ongoing good will project 2020. Our founder and CEO, Charles. C. Deena has indeed been a great Philanthropist to this generation and is truly committed to “giving while living,” and his decision to end his requirement of anonymity stems from this value. We (Atlantic Philanthropies Foundation) just recently organized and launched our internet donation program as this will enable us reach out to more people outside the shores of the United States and England, so they too can benefit from the fortune of Mr. Deena and our foundation as a whole. Many other major philanthropists look primarily to support large institutions and not individuals which is absolutely wrong thus we are changing such with this program. The launch of this internet/mobile donation program came up to avoid unsolicited pleas for donations and to avoid the idea of people feeling indebted to him/us. However, If you have received this message, please contact us with your Name, Age, Gender, Address/country of residence, Occupation and Telephone number to enable us do what is necessary because you are entitled to receive250,000.00 United Kingdom Pounds from our organization. Regards Anthony Lloyd Atlantic Philanthropies England and Wales004487-1237-2140",i05,Account and Access Management,"GENERAL SETTINGS
