11969,"RESPOND URGENT AND CONFIDENTIAL
Dear sir, I got your contact while searching for investment assistance; I am Mr. AHMED MUSTAPHA, aSierra Leonid. I am the firstborn of the deceased COL.ABUBAKAR MUSTAPHA a rebel leader of the Revolutionary United Front of Sierra Leone, who died, at battlefield during the West Africa peace keeping intervention at the peak of the Sierra Lesbian war. Before his death, he deposited an amount of three million seven hundred thousand American dollars(U.S.$3.700,000) in a private security company in Senegal. Presently, I want you to help me transfer the money into your accounts, so that you can help me to invest it and also to help me acquire naturalization status in your country. I will give you 10% as your reward and also 5% as miscellaneous expenses. I need your reply urgently to enable me forward the necessary information which protects the documents which are with me as the beneficiary. Furthermore, I hope to hear from you at the earliest convenient time. Yours sincerely Ahmed Moustafa.",i05,Account and Access Management,"GENERAL SETTINGS
