rnative and confidential email address chrisayo_5002@yahoo.it in to enable us proceed further with the transaction and also forward to me with the following information: your full mailing address, private telephone and fax number for easy communication. Best Regards Barrister Christopher Adele 		---------------------------------Con Yahoo! Mail protege la TUA Capella DI post the virus e spam",i05,Account and Access Management,"GENERAL SETTINGS
